{"id":"n67596-2-11","stage":5,"title":"열풍 · 热潮","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67596-2-11-1","ko":"아이들 사이에서 이 만화 열풍이 일고 있대요.","zh":"据说孩子们之间正在流行这部漫画呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이들","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들","audio":"/audio/8451fc733a6420da90ac.mp3"}},{"text":"사이에서","meaning":"间，之间，间距","explanation":"사이：间，之间，间距；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"1","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이에서","audio":"/audio/5d82060641cfb3131302.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"만화","meaning":"漫画","explanation":"만화：漫画。","readings":[{"term":"만화","audio":"/audio/84d97b13b15d5c175a7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53033","senseId":"1","lemma":"만화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만화","audio":"/audio/84d97b13b15d5c175a7f.mp3"}},{"text":"열풍이","meaning":"热潮","explanation":"열풍：热潮；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열풍","audio":"/audio/dec8036a916c2701ba03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67596","senseId":"2","lemma":"열풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열풍이","audio":"/audio/ee72e0693d7f87dd165f.mp3"}},{"text":"일고","meaning":"起","explanation":"일다：起；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"일다","audio":"/audio/443e78cd0e2673b0625a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72214","senseId":"1","lemma":"일다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일고","audio":"/audio/82ed041bfd32fb44d8e9.mp3"}},{"text":"있대요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있대요","audio":"/audio/5d7bae9813de71887d28.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"间，之间，间距","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"从一个物体到另一个物体，或从一处到另一处的距离或空间。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"84d97b13b15d5c17","term":"만화","zh":"漫画","audio":"/audio/84d97b13b15d5c175a7f.mp3","entryId":"53033","definition":"把人的人生、社会或者想象中的故事有趣地表现出来的画；或指由那种画编制的书。","pronunciation":["만ː화"]},{"id":"dec8036a916c2701","term":"열풍","zh":"热潮","audio":"/audio/dec8036a916c2701ba03.mp3","entryId":"67596","definition":"(喻义)非常强劲地发生的气势或现象。","pronunciation":["열풍"]},{"id":"443e78cd0e2673b0","term":"일다","zh":"起","audio":"/audio/443e78cd0e2673b0625a.mp3","entryId":"72214","definition":"某个现象或事件发生。","pronunciation":["일ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/71d7f371f218a3d4bae3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67596-2-11-2","ko":"그래요? 그럼 우리 아이도 한 권 사다 줘야겠네요.","zh":"是吗？那我也得给我们的孩子买一本啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래요?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"아이도","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이도","audio":"/audio/b61c412448de27500b8a.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"권","meaning":"本","explanation":"권：本。","readings":[{"term":"권","audio":"/audio/5e113c9ef13b571371a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62537","senseId":"1","lemma":"권","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"권","audio":"/audio/5e113c9ef13b571371a0.mp3"}},{"text":"사다","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}},{"text":"줘야겠네요.","meaning":"使感到，使受到，带来","